<title>UK: Two Brent cargoes kept, one clocked.</title>
<headline>Two Brent cargoes kept, one clocked.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Of the three Brent cargoes in the paper chains on Monday, two were subject to five o'clocking and one was kept, traders said.</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan kept one cargo and was five o'clocked on another. Phibro kept the third cargo.</p>
<p>The cargoes are due to load in the December 10-12 range.</p>
